shared/parity/.build/

# --- not part of this project ---
# A separate, empty Unity 6 project ("My project", the Hub's default name) was
# created inside this folder on 2026-08-20, most likely by Unity Hub defaulting
# its new-project location here. It is untouched on disk and should be moved
# out; ignoring it so `git add -A` cannot pull a second Unity project — Library
# folder and all — into this repo.
#
# NOT anchored with a leading slash: a copy has already turned up at
# unity/Pancing/My project/ as well, which a root-anchored rule missed.
My project/
